4b,$ then $b=$" :question/worked-solution "We need to isolate the variable $b.$ To do this, we treat $c$ as though it were a constant and apply the addition and multiplication principles as usual.\n\nFirst, we add $4b$ to both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b-5c & =c-4b \\\\ b-5c+4b & =c-4b+4b \\\\ b+4b-5c & =c-4b+4b \\\\ 5b-5c & =c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we add $5c$ to both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5b-5c & =c \\\\ 5b-5c+5c & =c+5c \\\\ 5b & =6c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide both sides of the equation by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5b & =6c \\\\ \\frac{5b}{5} & =\\frac{6c}{5} \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{5}b}{\\cancel{5}} & =\\frac{6c}{5} \\\\ b & =\\frac{6c}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id 17592186495079 :question/id #uuid "42436934-3a89-50ee-8455-624cf79683ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-176587" :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "57e54aa5-0ae5-5529-8641-8aded4a5dfa9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2y}{3}" :db/id 17592186494496}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id 17592186494496} :answer-field/id #uuid "c06f8f1f-3ac5-52a2-ba1c-01d871adb3a0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045492} :db/id 17592186495007}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485} :question/problem "Given that $2x-y=y-x,$ express $x$ in terms of $y.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We need to isolate the variable $x.$ To do this, we treat $y$ as though it were a constant and apply the addition and multiplication principles as usual.\n\nFirst, we add $y$ to both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-y & =y-x \\\\ 2x-y+y & =y-x+y \\\\ 2x & =-x+2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we add $x$ to both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x & =-x+2y \\\\ 2x+x & =-x+2y+x \\\\ 3x & =2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide both sides of the equation by $3:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =2y \\\\ \\frac{3x}{3} & =\\frac{2y}{3} \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{3}x}{\\cancel{3}} & =\\frac{2y}{3} \\\\ x & =\\frac{2y}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id 17592186048649} {:db/id 17592186048826 :topic/id #uuid "c375d3cc-e398-5a47-a69f-ddc853431752" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id 17592186073752 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id 17592186073445 :question/id #uuid "e9aae52c-65f3-5dff-bc6b-a530f8c7acc1" :question/math-academy-id "e-13009"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5e79a91b-c479-53da-9f06-59c082fa4187" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id 17592186048678} {:db/id 17592186050622}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id 17592186508241} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id 17592186074030 :question/id #uuid "acc0a44e-6eb6-5a95-a139-3841ec88693b" :question/math-academy-id "q-171690"} {:db/id 17592186074172 :question/id #uuid "963fb1bc-3f29-5c06-94a9-37168b40e1c1" :question/math-academy-id "q-4133"} {:db/id 17592186074185 :question/id #uuid "5c71bd6b-b9a3-5587-89f4-a14a2c760bc2" :question/math-academy-id "q-5179"} {:db/id 17592186233560 :question/id #uuid "ba03c851-f080-5b98-bcba-fc2174ffc663" :question/math-academy-id "q-167194"} {:db/id 17592186233567 :question/id #uuid "d104504e-e7b5-56df-8154-499bbc1d3f80" :question/math-academy-id "q-167210"} {:db/id 17592186233574 :question/id #uuid "6afc1799-60d6-5f69-94a5-994731079a93" :question/math-academy-id "q-167226"} {:db/id 17592186496226 :question/id #uuid "07b5302b-d797-5328-827e-aa28a460f929" :question/math-academy-id "q-181149"} {:db/id 17592186496255 :question/id #uuid "4c3907fe-c83e-5bd5-ac54-297aa503451b" :question/math-academy-id "q-181175"} {:db/id 17592186497411 :question/id #uuid "ededc7bf-b310-5714-a047-930df525362b" :question/math-academy-id "q-166843"} {:db/id 17592186503753 :question/id #uuid "ee041a5d-3530-58d3-9ad7-acdf10ca4984" :question/math-academy-id "q-166761"} {:db/id 17592186508171 :question/id #uuid "01d4210c-99cb-5509-8003-8615f9f2d644"} {:db/id 17592186508174 :question/id #uuid "1814dd75-6dc3-5a88-93bf-56fa1a5ec858"} {:db/id 17592186508179 :question